      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like i'm pretending to be a person all day and i'm just so tired of the performance. the worst part is that i have no reason to feel this way. i keep waiting for something bad to happen so i can actually justify the emptiness, but nothing does. it's just this endless, quiet nothingness.",
